    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Plan a Function with Inputs\r\n\r\n1. **Plan**\r\n   - Use the circles to annotate the user interactions that would change the output.\r\n   - Think about what information a streaming app needs to update what is featured.\r\n\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n2. **Check Your Plan**\r\n   - Do different inputs lead to different outputs?\r\n   - Is your function reusable?\r\n\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n3. **Save Your Work**\r\n   - Add your completed Sketch to your Backpack so you can use it in the next level.\r\n\r\n<br/>",
    "display_name": "Streaming Planner",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Plan how a streaming app updates what is featured using inputs like title and description to create different results.",
